<div id="2026-09-24-golden-data-grounding" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-09-24 — Golden Data contract, glossary and anti-hallucination grounding (shadow by default)</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Canonical AI glossary (<code>Util/AI/Glossary.pm</code>). New <code>AiGoldenData</code> Result (table <code>ai_golden_data</code>, pending schema-compare) + <code>Model::AI2::GoldenData</code> (ingest always <code>candidate</code>, no auto-promotion). <code>Model::AI2::Grounding</code> hooked into <code>/ai2/chat</code>: labelled [GOLDEN]/[CANDIDATE — unverified] Grounding Context, citation post-check, fixed no-golden fallback. Ledger (<code>ai_usage_logs</code>) records grounded / golden / candidate hit counts; admin monitor on <code>/ai/usage</code>.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Golden Data store is EMPTY / NOT YET QUALIFIED; factual answers must not be invented. Default mode <code>shadow</code> keeps live Chat unchanged; <code>{"grounding":"enforce"}</code> opts in per request.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>lib/Comserv/Util/AI/{Glossary,Ledger}.pm</code> <code>Model/AI2/{GoldenData,Grounding,UsageMonitor}.pm</code> <code>Result/AiGoldenData.pm</code> <code>Result/AiUsageLog.pm</code> <code>Model/AI/Usage.pm</code> <code>Model/AI2/Chat.pm</code> <code>Controller/AI2.pm</code> <code>Controller/AI.pm</code> <code>root/ai/usage_ledger.tt</code> <code>root/config/ai_grounding.json</code> <code>t/ai_golden_grounding.t</code></p>
